  statistics_percentile
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "percentile p = x(k) + f × (x(k + 1) - x(k)), where the rank 1 + (n - 1) × p / 100 = k + f is read over the values sorted ascending (linear interpolation between closest ranks, the C = 1 variant; Hyndman and Fan definition 7)"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Percentile#The_linear_interpolation_between_closest_ranks_method"
    lexeme en
      surface
        text percentile
      surface
        text percentiles
    lexeme ru
